Z||000010||Jake_Dragon||12-31-2001||07:10 AM||||I didnt use a ratchet to loosen mine, take a box end and put it on the T50, hold it close to the bolt head and tap it with a hammer.<BR>I have done both my cars that way.<BR>||||reg||1
